        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ellsworth \"Bumpy\" Johnson, Dutch Schultz, Lucky Luciano, Laurence Fishburne, Tim Roth, Andy García\n- Works: Hoodlum\n- Organizations: The Commission\n- Concepts: Modern organized crime in the United States\n\nFacts:\n- The film Hoodlum concentrated on Ellsworth \"Bumpy\" Johnson, Dutch Schultz, and Lucky Luciano.\n- In Hoodlum, Laurence Fishburne portrayed Ellsworth \"Bumpy\" Johnson, Tim Roth portrayed Dutch Schultz, and Andy García portrayed Lucky Luciano.\n- Lucky Luciano is considered the father of modern organized crime in the United States for establishing the first Commission.",
